'''Kerihime''' (ケリ姫 Kerihime, '''Kick Princess''') is a [[:Category:Collaboration Event Enemies|Collaboration Event]] enemy that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 1.4 Update|Version 1.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kerihime
|image = E 027.png
|appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,295¢
}}

==Enemy==
An enemy with an incredibly high knockback count but with very pitiful health and attack power. Due to her having Single Target attacks she won't be able to do much damage to your army. Her 8,000 knockbacks may seem like a threat but since she has the same amount of health she will be knocked back every time she has been attacked, making dealing with her trivial.

==Strategy==
Any [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cat]] can take out Kerihime easily as she is never a threat.

